WEBVTT

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.090
What's all this about?

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:15.990
They sure are on high security-pri.

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:31.450
It's been so long!

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:33.450
How nostalgic!

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:40.140
Don't let her within a one kilometre radius of me, got it Ando!?

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:53.990
Parajuku, do you understand me-daVinci?

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:56.380
I want to go to Parajuku-daVinci.

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:59.160
???

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:01.060
Ajimi-sensei?

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:02.520
Ah!

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:04.100
Fuwari-daVinci!

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:06.250
What are you doing here-daVinci?

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:08.990
I'm on a layover from the Palps.

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:11.160
I'm heading back to Parajuku.

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:13.210
Good timing!

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:51.020
Curly-chan
of Persailles-daVinci

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:41.020
Cyalume Change!

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:15.260
Garuru made it all the way through without stumbling!

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:17.100
She's become such a great idol-kuma!

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:23.220
Thanks, bye bye.

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:24.530
Come again!

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.900
Let's eat nikuman together-nano!

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:28.000
See you later!

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.200
Garuru!

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:30.950
We'll be waiting-pri!

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:33.540
Take care of unicorn!

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:36.530
Garu!

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:45.070
It's been a while!

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:46.460
Huh?

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:48.090
A castle-daVinci?

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:50.770
Ah, so this is the CelePara castle I've heard about.

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:52.490
Fuwari-tori?

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:53.890
Are you really back-tori?

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.200
I thought it was a lie-tori!

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.310
I can't believe it-tori!

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:59.880
I'm so happy that I'm scared-tori!

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:02.040
I'm back Toriko-san.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:07.480
Garuru has gone back,

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:11.090
but we've all gotta do our best so we can perform together when she comes back-pri.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:11.900
Yeah.

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:13.080
Me too.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.750
Yeah, altogether now,

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.080
Capisce!

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:21.210
We're back!

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:22.020
Fuwari! Ms Ajimi!

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:23.410
Fuwari! Ajimi-sensei!

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:24.920
You've come back-pri!

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:26.380
I'm so glad!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:29.350
I was worried that that you weren't coming back.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:30.550
Welcome back-pri!

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:34.980
Ajimi-san has something to tell you all.

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:38.970
Thanks for waiting!

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:41.810
I've remembered everything-daVinci!

00:05:41.810 --> 00:05:43.560
Remembered what?

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:47.050
Something really important about Shikyouin Hibiki-daVinci!

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:51.250
Something about Shikyouin Hibiki?

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:56.990
The story is about

00:05:56.990 --> 00:05:58.930
my memories and Shikyouin's villa.

00:05:58.930 --> 00:06:02.030
I spoke with the gardener there.

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:05.100
He said there was a rich young girl who

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:07.100
all of a sudden became very unhappy.

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:10.740
She was being toyed with by fate

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:13.240
and she returned in an anime-daVinci!

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:16.180
What do you mean? I don't get it!

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:22.120
Ajimi has seen the truth! The so-called "deliquent girl" Shikyouin Hibiki 24H!

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:26.880
I've made this film from what Ajimi-sensei said,

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:30.170
also I've removed her "colorful expressions"-pri.

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:36.350
Ten years ago, I lived on the outskirts of

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:39.780
a town called Persailles-daVinci...

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:41.160
She just said DaVinci!!!

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:43.870
She says it so much it's impossible to get them all!

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:48.470
What nice weather!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.060
I'm hungry!

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:52.160
Let's go get some fruit!

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:54.850
This is me when I was a little-daVinci!

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:08.100
There's so much fruit!

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:10.700
Thanks for the food!

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:16.500
Instead of art expressions they were fruit expressions when you were younger!?

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:21.240
If it were now, she would use "Chogall" for that pun-nano!

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:23.130
No, she would probably use "Mucha".

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:24.610
I think what's more important is

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:28.330
that she broke in to someones garden and stole their fruit-pri!

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:31.850
Everyone, hurry up!

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:34.670
Hibiki-chan, wait!

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:37.620
This fast, curly-haired girl

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:40.480
is Shikyouin Hibiki when she was younger-daVinci.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:43.440
So I called her Curly-chan-daVinci.

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:47.140
M'lady, it's time for dessert.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.060
Okay!

00:07:51.890 --> 00:07:53.310
Eat up!

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:56.070
Amazing!

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:58.200
What luxury cake!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:02.420
We can always eat tasty sweets when we come to Hibiki-chan's house!

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:07.840
You again! Fruit thief!

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:09.480
Get out!

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:12.300
Fruit is for everyone!

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:13.960
Wait!

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:16.350
Pay it no mind, m'lady.

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:22.290
So she was rich from the get go...

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:35.920
Hibiki-sama, a splendid morning to you.

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:38.270
Morning, let's go everyone!

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:40.790
Hibiki-chan!

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:43.360
And the starring role is no other than...

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:45.360
Hibiki-chan!

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:54.920
I shall make these rotten trees sprout roses with my own power!

00:08:55.690 --> 00:08:57.340
Hibiki-chan you're amazing!

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:59.010
Hibiki-chan is a star!

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:11.030
Help!

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:13.400
Don't worry, hold on tight!

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:15.310
Hibiki-chan!

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:22.810
Hibiki-chan, don't let go!

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:30.000
Thank you so much Hibiki-chan!

00:09:47.510 --> 00:09:50.070
Mother, Father, where are you going?

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:56.420
Your father is going on an aniversary voyage on his foundation's boat.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:59.790
You'll be looking after the house with me for a while.

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:04.250
That's fine, I have so many friends I won't miss them!

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:06.630
Have a nice trip!

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:10.650
I heard Hibiki-chan's mom and dad

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:13.850
are on the world's biggest boat!

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:16.460
I bet it's a really luxurious boat!

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:18.330
We want to ride it!

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:20.190
Then we'll all go on a trip on it next time!

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:23.960
I'm so glad I'm Hibiki-chan's friend!

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:31.260
I love Saints!

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:32.860
They're amazing aren't they?

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.520
Let's play "Pretend Friend Tickets".

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:37.110
Okay!

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:39.520
I'll snap with Hibiki-chan!

00:10:39.520 --> 00:10:41.440
Me too! Me too!

00:10:46.760 --> 00:10:48.360
We're all friends!

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:51.510
All friends...

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:55.920
So Hibiki played "Pretend Friend Tickets" too...

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:59.010
We played it alot too before our PriTickets came.

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:02.630
I never knew Shikyouin-dono was once like that...

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.400
When our real PriTickets come

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:09.670
let's all go to PriPara together!

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:13.040
Of course, we're all

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:14.940
such good friends!

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:19.540
Hibiki, m'lady!

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:22.220
What's wrong? Why are you making such a scary face?

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:25.140
The Paprica Foundation ship that departed this morning has

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:28.400
been caught in a storm in the Permuda Triangle!

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:49.550
Unfortunately, there are no survivors...

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:53.600
All that's left for you is,

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:55.500
a large amount of debt!

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:58.230
I'll take this as a substitute for severance!

00:11:59.030 --> 00:11:59.780
Wait!

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:00.910
What are you doing!?

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.070
Don't go!

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:04.300
Pleas don't go!

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:15.710
Shall we go home then too?

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:16.930
Yes, lets.

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:17.610
Why?

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:19.070
Well, because...

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:20.970
You don't have money anymore...

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:24.950
So even if we play together, we can't eat nice desserts.

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:28.560
Mom told me that rich people should only play with other rich people.

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:29.810
Wait!

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:32.710
You all said we were good friends a while ago!

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:33.790
We snapped friend tickets!

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:35.390
We're not friends anymore...

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:45.560
She was always cheeky.

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:47.500
Right?

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:51.280
Friend Ticket? What are you talking about?

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:54.130
If you're a rich person, bring real ones.

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:55.860
I feel revitalized.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:58.500
They became tired of the selfish princess.

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:01.060
Come play games and mine together, everyone!

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:15.000
How cruel!

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:18.310
True friends are supposed to help in times of need!

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:22.820
The situation suddenly changed the following morning-daVinci.

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:31.810
Hello?

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:34.660
Hibiki, it's your father, I'm safe!

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:37.920
Your mother is too, everyone on the boat is!

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:42.210
Good morning, m'lady!

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:45.480
I'll prepare some warm food for you.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:49.520
Hibiki-chan, the boat was safe, wasn't it!

00:13:49.650 --> 00:13:50.850
Thank goodness!

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.260
I was so worried!

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:54.340
Me too!

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:58.990
Should we carry on playing Pretend Friend Tickets?

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:00.630
Yeah, let's snap!

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:04.200
Yeah, we're all such good friends after all!

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:09.020
Leave.

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:10.780
What do you mean friends?

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.240
Don't joke me around!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:13.810
Friend Ticket!?

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:16.080
It's all lies!

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:17.840
M'lady!

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:21.450
Everyone get out!

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.360
Eh!?

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:35.650
So everyone came back
when they found out she was rich again...

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:37.770
That's so cruel!

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:43.100
It'd be impossible to trust friends again after that-pri.

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:50.950
After that Curly-chan shut herself in her mansion all alone-daVinci.

00:14:56.140 --> 00:14:57.930
Let's go.

00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:02.010
M'lady!

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:04.040
Ahahaha!

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:05.700
Let's go.

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:07.880
M'lady!

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:08.860
Ahahaha!

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:10.440
Let's go.

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:11.330
M'lady!

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:11.970
Ahahaha!

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:13.120
Lets go.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:13.930
M'lady!

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:20.210
She'll go crazy at this rate...

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:22.400
I thought.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:26.990
My only option was to become her friend-daVinci!

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:32.920
Good morning Curly-chan!

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:37.040
I'm here, so you'll be fine!

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:46.110
Hello?

00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:47.490
HELLO!

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:48.700
How are you?

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:51.600
You're fine because I'm here!

00:15:53.210 --> 00:15:55.840
Curly-chan why did you hang up?

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:58.480
I'm your friend Curly-chan!

00:15:58.480 --> 00:16:00.080
Let's be together!

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:02.330
Curly-chan how's it going?

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:05.270
I'm your friend so let's play!

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:09.070
Wait, don't close it!

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:12.000
I can come in through the toilet too!

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:14.650
Hello from the ventilation fan!

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:20.280
I'm not Santa, but here I am!

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:24.910
Curly-chan! Curly-chan! Curly-chan! Curly-chan!

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:27.140
Stay away!

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:29.840
Sounds like a horror movie.

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.800
Scarier than a devil's curse!

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:37.290
I tried so hard to become Curly-chan's friend-daVinci.

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:39.250
You took it a bit far-pri...

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:43.770
I'm so scared.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:48.430
CURLY-CHAN, ARE YOU THERE?

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:52.550
I'll be your friend from today!

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:54.360
Let's be friends!

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:58.530
Open the window!

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:02.700
(Ajimi noises)

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:06.380
I'm rearing to go! You aren't alone anymore!

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:09.100
Let's have fun!

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:10.250
STOP!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:11.760
MAKE IT STOP!!

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:15.000
You took it too far...

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:17.820
And from then on,

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:22.700
I chased Curly-chan all over to become friends-daVinci.

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:26.480
Eventually we arrived at an art gallery in Pitaly-daVinci.

00:17:27.970 --> 00:17:29.880
Curly-chan!

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:34.860
Wait!

00:17:35.390 --> 00:17:37.400
Curly-chan!

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:38.070
Ah?

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:46.510
Art is amazing-daVinci!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:54.480
Leonardo Da Vin...

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:59.140
Da-Da-Da Vinci!

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:02.880
Curly-chan?

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:07.040
I see,

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:11.540
so that's how your sentence enders went from fruits to art related.

00:18:11.540 --> 00:18:13.320
Exactly-daVinci!

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:20.320
I now understand that since Hibiki-san was little, she went through a lot.

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:24.500
And that's why she hates sentence enders so much-pri.

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:30.290
I completely understand why Hibiki is that way now.

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:32.960
And I'm hungry too-nano.

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:37.450
And after that, Curly-chan...

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:45.680
I like you.

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:51.090
Lady Hibiki, suffered a lot

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:53.090
and so

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:56.130
now thinks that everything in the world is a lie

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:59.130
becoming unable to trust anyone.

00:19:04.060 --> 00:19:06.860
Despite making CelePara castle

00:19:06.860 --> 00:19:09.470
and making PriPara in your own image,

00:19:09.470 --> 00:19:11.330
you sure don't seem happy, Maho-chan.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:15.980
That's not true.

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:20.560
It's not that I don't understand how she felt,

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:24.200
but constantly going on about "genius this" and "CelePara that"

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:27.220
is really weird, is she an idiot?

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:29.170
Dorothy, relax.

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:31.390
Regardless,

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:34.900
I'm not yet finished making my ideal PriPara.

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:38.690
My final goal is

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:43.330
to become a Vocal Doll like you, Falulu.

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:46.110
Maho-chan?

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:59.010
And so I will become the Four Seasons Princess and have my wish granted by the Miracle Mirror.

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:01.180
But Maho-chan...

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:04.400
Vocal Dolls can't leave PriPara.

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:06.100
Are you okay with that?

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:07.650
Of course,

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:10.660
the outside world is filled with lies anyway.

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:14.210
PriPara is where I belong.

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:16.580
I see...

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:27.210
W-Who is that?

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:29.240
Huh?

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:31.120
There's nobody there.

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:33.230
Princess Falulu, excuse me!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:34.440
Maho-chan?

00:20:36.320 --> 00:20:37.360
Who are you?

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:38.560
What's your motive!?
